# CITATION.cff for the datazoom.saude R package.
# Enables GitHub's "Cite this repository" button. Keep in sync with
# DESCRIPTION and inst/CITATION when the version or authors change.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use datazoom.saude in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "datazoom.saude: Download Brazilian Public Health Microdata from DATASUS"
abstract: >-
  R package to download, clean, and standardize Brazilian public health
  microdata from DATASUS, the Department of Informatics of the Brazilian
  Unified Health System (SUS). Covers mortality (SIM), live births (SINASC),
  hospital admissions (SIH), outpatient procedures (SIA), hospital beds
  (CNES), oncology cases (PO) and vaccination (SI-PNI), with variable names
  and labels in English or Portuguese.
